    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d575">

                <pb facs="0556" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg480"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17384</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Letcher to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-09T15:00:00-07:04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 9, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Gutierrez has informed me of Columbus attack by Villa requesting that I
                    inform the Government of the United States that orders have been given for
                    capture of the banditti from Mexican side.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
